From f9c52de329811b936f346e634877b5a03c7ef4cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aniket Randive <quic_arandive@quicinc.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Oct 2024 11:54:44 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 05/12] PENDING: soc: qcom: ccu-qup: Add CCU QUP platform
 driver

This patch adds the CCU QUP platform driver and implements
the following APIs to support CCU QUP use cases:
- Firmware load support for CCU QUP
- Reset the GPII
- Configure CCU mode and channel type
- API for sync ID to sync channel mapping
- API to set inter-transfer delay
- API for power on and power off
- Support for GPII interrupt aggregation

These changes enhance the functionality and flexibility
of the CCU QUP platform.

Change-Id: If89569f6aba5107d9777b2d8717ecc5d7fa6cf1b
Signed-off-by: Aniket Randive <quic_arandive@quicinc.com>
